aption_caption-header__4xmz_" data-testid="caption-header"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_209_94274)"><path opacity="0.16" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M14 4H2V10.6667C2 11.403 2.59695 12 3.33333 12H12.6667C13.403 12 14 11.403 14 10.6667V4ZM8 10C9.10457 10 10 9.10457 10 8C10 6.89543 9.10457 6 8 6C6.89543 6 6 6.89543 6 8C6 9.10457 6.89543 10 8 10Z" fill="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)"></path><path d="M2 3.33331H14V11.3333C14 12.0697 13.403 12.6666 12.6667 12.6666H3.33333C2.59695 12.6666 2 12.0697 2 11.3333V3.33331Z" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></circle><path d="M11.3332 1.33331L12.6665 1.33331" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_209_94274"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span><p aria-label="A popular Easter treat could trigger a false breathalyser test" class="ImageCaption_caption-title__ccyQU" data-testid="caption-title">A popular Easter treat could trigger a false breathalyser test<cite aria-label="Image: PA" class="ImageCaption_caption-credit__wlx1W" data-testid="caption-credit">(Image: PA)</cite></p></figcaption></div></button><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph"><a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/all-about/easter" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">Easter</a> is a holiday filled with great food choices. From c<a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/news/uk-world-news/biggest-heaviest-easter-egg-uk-35026405" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">hocolate eggs</a> to roast lamb with all the trimmings there&#x27;s no shortage of yummy grub to see you through. But drivers are being sounded a cautionary warning over eating one Easter staple before jumping behind the wheel of the car.</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-1" data-position="1"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="1" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 iygchX"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">The humble hot cross bun, which comes in many variations nowadays, can land you in hot water if you are pulled over and <a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/all-about/drink-driving" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">breathalysed, </a>say insurance experts. And that&#x27;s because the popular treat can trigger a false positive result on the breath test so you might want to abstain if you&#x27;re planning on heading out in the car.</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-2" data-position="2"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="2" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 FIxod"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Motoring experts from <a aria-label="Ripe Motorhome InsuranceLink opens in a new tab." class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://go.skimresources.com?id=76202X1529444&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ripeinsurance.co.uk%2Fmotorhome-insurance%2F&amp;sref=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dailyrecord.co.uk%2Flifestyle%2Fdrivers-warned-easter-treat-can-35037181" rel="nofollow" tabindex="0" target="_blank">Ripe Motorhome Insurance</a> have shared an important reminder to motorists to be aware of the lesser-known side effects of the sweet buns, which symbolise the crucifixion of <a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/news/uk-world-news/tiktoker-jailed-after-saying-jesus-34994715" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">Jesus </a>and the rebirth of spring, on a breathalyser test.</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-3" data-position="3"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="3" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 iygchX"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Alan Thomas, CEO of Ripe Motorhome Insurance, explained: “Just one bite of a <a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/lifestyle/food-drink/ms-shoppers-say-same-thing-34963751" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">hot cross bun</a> can increase your blood alcohol level from 0 up to 0.018.”</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_non-commercial__aiWwo" data-testid="recommended-1" data-position="4"></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">However, rest assured that consuming a couple of them before driving won&#x27;t be putting you over the legal limit to drive.</p><div data-testid="image-group"><button type="button" class="SlideViewerButton_slide-viewer-button__BDJoG" aria-label="Open image viewer" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="image-lightbox"><div class="ImageEmbed_image-embed__0T8WX false" data-testid="imageembed-34959891" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-articleid="34959891" data-tmdatatrack-type="image"><div class="ImageEmbed_image-container__2AIQm"><figure class="Figure_figure__Uce4f" style="--figure-aspect-ratio:0.6666666666666666"><img alt="Hot cross buns can be toxic for our furry friends as they contain dried fruits." loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 458px) 458px, (max-width: 615px) 615px, 1200px" src="https://i2-prod.dailyrecord.co.uk/article34959891.ece/ALTERNATES/s1200e/0_JS328925399.jpg" srcSet="https://i2-prod.dailyrecord.co.uk/article34959891.ece/ALTERNATES/s458b/0_JS328925399.jpg 458w, https://i2-prod.dailyrecord.co.uk/article34959891.ece/ALTERNATES/s615b/0_JS328925399.jpg 615w, https://i2-prod.dailyrecord.co.uk/article34959891.ece/ALTERNATES/s1200e/0_JS328925399.jpg 1200w"/><div class="ImageCountLabel_view-images-label__pxKau" data-testid="image-count-label"><div data-testid="label" class="Tag_label__s0LCV label--section-color "><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-testid="icon-camera"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_11032_234208)"><path opacity="0.16" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M21 6H3V16C3 17.1046 3.89543 18 5 18H19C20.1046 18 21 17.1046 21 16V6ZM12 15C13.6569 15 15 13.6569 15 12C15 10.3431 13.6569 9 12 9C10.3431 9 9 10.3431 9 12C9 13.6569 10.3431 15 12 15Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M17 2L19 2M3 5H21V17C21 18.1046 20.1046 19 19 19H5C3.89543 19 3 18.1046 3 17V5ZM15 12C15 13.6569 13.6569 15 12 15C10.3431 15 9 13.6569 9 12C9 10.3431 10.3431 9 12 9C13.6569 9 15 10.3431 15 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_11032_234208"><rect width="24" height="24" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg><span data-testid="label-text" class="Tag_text__ED20G">View 2 Images</span></div></div></figure></div><figcaption class="ImageCaption_caption__j7HRu" data-testid="image-caption"><span class="ImageCaption_caption-header__4xmz_" data-testid="caption-header"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_209_94274)"><path opacity="0.16" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M14 4H2V10.6667C2 11.403 2.59695 12 3.33333 12H12.6667C13.403 12 14 11.403 14 10.6667V4ZM8 10C9.10457 10 10 9.10457 10 8C10 6.89543 9.10457 6 8 6C6.89543 6 6 6.89543 6 8C6 9.10457 6.89543 10 8 10Z" fill="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)"></path><path d="M2 3.33331H14V11.3333C14 12.0697 13.403 12.6666 12.6667 12.6666H3.33333C2.59695 12.6666 2 12.0697 2 11.3333V3.33331Z" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></circle><path d="M11.3332 1.33331L12.6665 1.33331" stroke="var(--color-sem-icon-primary-default)" stroke-width="1.33333" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_209_94274"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span><p aria-label="Hot cross buns can skew a breathalyser test" class="ImageCaption_caption-title__ccyQU" data-testid="caption-title">Hot cross buns can skew a breathalyser test<cite aria-label="Image: Getty Images" class="ImageCaption_caption-credit__wlx1W" data-testid="caption-credit">(Image: Getty Images)</cite></p></figcaption></div></button></div><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-4" data-position="5"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="4" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 FIxod"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_non-commercial__aiWwo" data-testid="non-commercial-1" data-position="6"></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Thomas said: &quot;Foods that have started to <a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/lifestyle/michael-mosley-shares-go-breakfast-30484609" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">ferment</a>, such as hot cross buns containing yeast, can create trace amounts of mouth alcohol, which may show up on a breathalyser test.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">&quot;While this isn’t reflective of the actual <a aria-label="" class="TextLink_text-link__dBSS0 TextLink_enabled__dJF3l" href="https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/news/uk-world-news/how-long-alcohol-stays-your-25738119" rel="follow" tabindex="0" target="_self">blood alcohol level </a>in your system, this means that consuming a hot cross bun or two could get you into hot water if pulled over and lead to an unnecessary follow-up test which is the last thing you’d want over the Easter weekend!&quot;</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">If you were pulled over and tested after chomping on a hot cross bun, any skewing of the test would be temporary. That&#x27;s because they contain sugars which can interfere with the reading.</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-5" data-position="7"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="5" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 hNSrwU"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">But these sugars will quickly pass through your system and the reading will return to normal in a short period of time. This would usually happen within around ten minutes.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">And there&#x27;s no need to panic if you find yourself in this situation. Police breathalysers normally involve a waiting period and several tests to mitigate this type of error.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Hot cross buns aren&#x27;t the only foods that can throw up these types of false positives on a breathalyser test.</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-6" data-position="8"><div data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="6" data-tmdatatrack-id="placeholder" class="sc-8cd46d9c-0 hNSrwU"><span aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="react-loading-skeleton" style="width:100%;height:100%;--base-color:#88888810;--highlight-color:#8888880d">‌</span><br/></span></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Other foods and drinks include fermented drinks such as kombucha, some energy drinks, foods like sauerkraut, kimchi and even yoghurts, which too have been through the fermentation process.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Even vanilla extract, which contains 35% alcohol, could be detected by a breathalyser although consuming it would not make you intoxicated.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">Scotland has the lowest drink driving limits in the UK, 22 microgrammes (mcg) of alcohol in 100 ml of breath, 50 milligrammes (mg) of alcohol in 100ml of blood and 67 milligrammes (mg) in 100 ml of urine</p><div class="BoxStyles_box-container__Qk3WH BoxStyles_commercial__Wo6Z4" data-testid="commercial-7" data-position="9"><div data-testid="commercial-label-mantisCarousel" class="sc-255f486b-4 lovMQD commercial-label-style"><span class="sc-255f486b-0 kRmbNa">Article continues below</span><div data-testid="ad-info" class="sc-255f486b-1 gyrzvf commercial-label-ad-info-style"></div><div id="mantis-ui-widget-1-bart" class="sc-255f486b-2 frkNWL"></div></div><div data-testid="commercial-mid-article-box-last" data-tmdatatrack="non-content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="commercial" data-tmdatatrack-index="1000" data-tmdatatrack-id="mantisCarousel" class="sc-3467c75c-0 iGxxyq"><div class="sc-3ec2e2de-0 cjmnFp"><mantis-ui-widget id="mantis-ui-widget-1" data-config="{&quot;displayAdSlots&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;leaderBoardEnabled&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;adsEnabled&quot;:&quot;true&quot;}" data-testid="mantis-carousel"></mantis-ui-widget></div></div></div><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">So if you&#x27;re partial to a hot cross bun during the spring season there&#x27;s no need to worry.</p><p class="Paragraph_paragraph-text__PVKlh" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit" data-tmdatatrack-type="paragraph">The advice is to just wash it down with a glass of water before driving if you’re worried about a false-positive reading.</p><div class="HtmlEmbed_container__x6svQ"><div class="undefined  HtmlEmbed_right-handrail-enabled__3asnM" data-testid="htmlembed" data-tmdatatrack="content-unit"></div></div></article><section class="GooglePreferredSource_wrapper__lSRA6" data-testid="inline-google-preferred-source-ncu" data-tmdatatrack="google-preferred" data-tmdatatrack-type="article" data-tmdatatrack-id="article-google-preferred"><a data-testid="clickable" class="GooglePreferredSource_clickable__7nS3B" href="https://google.com/preferences/source?q=dailyrecord.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="GooglePreferredSource_cta__IYcVS"><div class="GooglePreferredSource_header__LyMU8"><div class="SquareLogo_square-logo__8cLh_ SquareLogo_small__IqVph GooglePreferredSource_logo__EwAMP" data-testid="square-logo"><div class="small SquareLogo_small__IqVph"><img title="Dailyrecord Icon" alt="The Daily Record" role="img" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fdailyrecord%2Flogos%2Fdailyrecord-square-icon.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fdailyrecord%2Flogos%2Fdailyrecord-square-icon.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fdailyrecord%2Flogos%2Fdailyrecord-square-icon.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/></div></div><h4 class="__className_b5eaf9 GooglePreferredSource_title__Bavnq">ENJOYED THIS STORY?</h4></div><p class="__className_fe3bd2 GooglePreferredSource_body__JVnuK">Choose Daily Record as a &#x27;Preferred Source&#x27; on Google News for quick access to the news you value.</p></div><img alt="Google Preferred Source Badge" loading="lazy" width="204" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="GooglePreferredSource_badge__mcsG5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgoogle-preferred-source-badge-dark.png&amp;w=25